 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2017-01-24",
   "text": "Death Tax Repeal Act of 2017\n This bill amends the Internal Revenue Code to: (1) repeal the estate and generation-skipping transfer taxes, and (2) make permanent the maximum 35% gift tax rate and the lifetime gift tax exemption. The bill provides for an inflation adjustment to such exemption amount."
  }
